{
  "bookId": "hero-212201",
  "id": "bond-26020",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26020001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "哦哦，这个房子真不错！可以用来做「道义堂」的手办世界分馆呢！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "真的要送给我吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "太感谢了！以为打群架叫上我，绝对不带含糊的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "听起来真让人安心。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "不过这个礼物对我来说还是太过贵重了，我还是不能轻易接受……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "不然，这家武道馆就当作是我们两人共同经营的吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "共同经营？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "嗯！就不叫道义堂了，从我们两个人的名字中各取一个字怎么样？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "夏澄阳子",
          "text": "听起来有种夫妻店的感觉呢！不然就这么决定了吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26020011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "诶？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
